,"e":251.47,"line":59},{"w":"stealing","s":251.47,"e":252.28,"line":59},{"w":"the","s":252.28,"e":252.59,"line":59},{"w":"show.","s":252.59,"e":253.1,"line":59}],"lines":[{"s":1.2,"e":5.05,"text":"Soft shoes shuffle as the sunlight breaks,"},{"s":5.05,"e":9.28,"text":"Skate wheels sing past the pictures she makes."},{"s":9.28,"e":13.59,"text":"Sidewalk Picasso, she skates through the light,"},{"s":13.59,"e":18.45,"text":"Spinning past storefronts, she paints the day bright."},{"s":18.45,"e":22.67,"text":"Bright brushstrokes bloom in a colorful stack,"},{"s":22.67,"e":27.54,"text":"She shared all her sketches straight out of her pack."},{"s":27.54,"e":31.76,"text":"Four fearless wheels fly fast down the street,"},{"s":31.76,"e":36.25,"text":"Cool colors and kindness make days feel complete."},{"s":36.25,"e":40.02,"text":"She gave me her gallery, gift after gift,"},{"s":40.02,"e":44.79,"text":"Those sweet, shining sketches gave my spirit a lift."},{"s":44.79,"e":48.64,"text":"Cousins come clapping, a cheer and a grin,"},{"s":48.64,"e":52.31,"text":"Big, beaming aunties and uncles join in."},{"s":52.31,"e":56.35,"text":"Grandparents gather, their glad voices rise,"},{"s":56.35,"e":60.85,"text":"The big, bustling bunch brings stars to her eyes!"},{"s":60.85,"e":63.78,"text":"LUNA, Luna, let your colors fly!"},{"s":63.78,"e":68.47,"text":"Skate through the sunshine, send sparks to the sky!"},{"s":68.47,"e":72.04,"text":"SIDEWALK PICASSO, so splendidly bright,"},{"s":72.04,"e":76.36,"text":"Bold brushstrokes bloom in the beautiful light!"},{"s":76.36,"e":81.04,"text":"When wild winds whistle, your family comes through,"},{"s":81.04,"e":84.8,"text":"Cousins and kinfolk come running for you!"},{"s":84.8,"e":89.2,"text":"Keep rolling, keep rising, keep making your art,"},{"s":89.2,"e":93.24,"text":"Sweet, shining Luna, you've got a big heart!"},{"s":93.24,"e":97.65,"text":"One breezy blue morning, her board took a slide,"},{"s":97.65,"e":101.68,"text":"Her wheels went wandering, veering too wide."},{"s":101.68,"e":106.36,"text":"She wobbled, went weightless, gave one little call,"},{"s":106.36,"e":111.32,"text":"Quick cousins came catching and SAVED her from a fall!"},{"s":111.32,"e":115.73,"text":"Brave, bustling uncles brought her back upright,"},{"s":115.73,"e":119.76,"text":"Sweet, steady aunties squeezed her so tight."},{"s":119.76,"e":124.08,"text":"Grandparents gathered with glad, glowing pride,"},{"s":124.08,"e":128.48,"text":"Her huge, happy family stood strong at her side!"},{"s":128.48,"e":131.42,"text":"LUNA, Luna, let your colors fly!"},{"s":131.42,"e":136.1,"text":"Skate through the sunshine, send sparks to the sky!"},{"s":136.1,"e":139.68,"text":"SIDEWALK PICASSO, so splendidly bright,"},{"s":139.68,"e":143.99,"text":"Bold brushstrokes bloom in the beautiful light!"},{"s":143.99,"e":148.67,"text":"When wild winds whistle, your family comes through,"},{"s":148.67,"e":152.43,"text":"Cousins and kinfolk come running for you!"},{"s":152.43,"e":156.84,"text":"Keep rolling, keep rising, keep making your art,"},{"s":156.84,"e":160.87,"text":"Sweet, shining Luna, you've got a big heart!"},{"s":160.87,"e":164.82,"text":"Click-clack, colorful wheels on the ground!"},{"s":164.82,"e":168.58,"text":"Clap-clap, cousins make a cheering sound!"},{"s":168.58,"e":172.9,"text":"Paint-splash, priceless pictures passed around!"},{"s":172.9,"e":176.66,"text":"Big, beaming faces keep gathering 'round!"},{"s":176.66,"e":180.79,"text":"Your gorgeous gifts gave my whole day a glow,"},{"s":180.79,"e":186.2,"text":"Those bold, beautiful brushstrokes mean more than you know."},{"s":186.2,"e":191.43,"text":"Through tumbles and triumphs, your team makes you strong,"},{"s":191.43,"e":195.93,"text":"With cousins and kinfolk, they're cheering along."},{"s":195.93,"e":200.52,"text":"From grandmas to grandpas, love lights up the way,"},{"s":200.52,"e":204.19,"text":"Your huge, happy family is here to stay."},{"s":204.19,"e":209.14,"text":"Keep skating, keep sketching, keep shining your light,"},{"s":209.14,"e":213,"text":"Your pictures put pure joy in plain sight."},{"s":213,"e":215.93,"text":"LUNA, LUNA, let your colors fly!"},{"s":215.93,"e":220.61,"text":"Skate through the sunshine, send sparks to the sky!"},{"s":220.61,"e":224.19,"text":"SIDEWALK PICASSO, so splendidly bright,"},{"s":224.19,"e":228.51,"text":"Bold brushstrokes bloom in the beautiful light!"},{"s":228.51,"e":233.19,"text":"When wild winds whistle, your family comes through,"},{"s":233.19,"e":236.95,"text":"Cousins and kinfolk come running for you!"},{"s":236.95,"e":241.35,"text":"Keep rolling, keep rising, keep making your art,"},{"s":241.35,"e":245.39,"text":"Sweet, shining Luna, you've got a big heart!"},{"s":245.39,"e":249.43,"text":"Sweet, shining Luna, your colors still glow,"},{"s":249.43,"e":253.1,"text":"Sidewalk Picasso—keep stealing the show."}],"duration":253.6,"source":"estimated","generatedAt":null}